Text Notes 650 6750 0 45 ~ 0
Good Display specifies 9 LEDs in parallel, 2.8-3.3V, <=60mA. Exact six-tail conductor duplication/order is still held for physical FL21 verification.
Text Notes 650 6875 0 45 ~ 0
